        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 3400 Two Tone Contemporary Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nVery <b>Contemporary Two Tone</b> door pull from First Impressions. The back flat portion of the pull is Satin Nickel and the front raised portion is Polished Chrome. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary designed pull is constructed of durable aluminum. It  is a great choice for residential and commercial applications such as hotels or restaurants.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary door pull can be used in many applications such as:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Entrance and Patio Doors</li>\r\n<li>Appliances, such as Refrigerators and Freezers</li>\r\n<li>Glass Doors, such as on Showers or Storefronts</li>\r\n<li>Furniture, such as Armoires</li>\r\n<li>Just about anywhere a door pull is needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 3400 Contemporary Door Pull</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel (bottom) with Polished Chrome (top)</li>\r\n<li>Non Rusting Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\">\r\n<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>First Impressions FII-3400 available in 3 different sizes.</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-3400-9: Total Length 9\" -  Center to Center Mount: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-3400-12:  Total Length 12\" -  Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-3400-18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSold individually.\r\n</p>",
